{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13457","headline":"寄阎防 · 刘眘虚","name":"寄阎防","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青冥南山口，君与缁锡邻。\n深路入古寺，乱花随暮春。\n纷纷对寂莫，往往落衣巾。\n松色空照水，经声时有人。\n晚心复南望，山远情独亲。\n应以修往业，亦惟立此身。\n深林度空夜，烟月资清真。\n莫叹文明日，弥年徒隐沦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}